OL,3,GNEWSAJersey 'working closely' with UK
OL,4,Aon Brexit deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's government has been "working
OL,7,Fclosely" with the UK to ensure the
OL,8,Fisland benefits from a draft deal on
OL,9,Fremoving post-Brexit checks from food
OL,10,Fand agriculture exports.
OL,12,FThe BBC understands the 200-page draft
OL,13,Ftext for this so called "SPS" [sanitary
OL,14,Fand phytosanitary] agreement has been
OL,15,Fcirculated to EU nations ahead of a
OL,16,Fmeeting next week.
OL,18,FA Government of Jersey spokesperson
OL,19,Fsaid: "It's too early to guarantee our
OL,20,Fautomatic inclusion."
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
