OL,3,GNEWSAJersey 'working closely' with UK
OL,4,Aon Brexit deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey added: "We expect Jersey to see a
OL,7,Freduction in trade barriers, making it
OL,8,Feasier and more cost-effective for
OL,9,Fwholesalers and retailers to both
OL,10,Fexport to, and source specialist
OL,11,Fproducts from, the EU and Northern
OL,12,FIreland."
